<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to October 1 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to October 1 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to October 1 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>					    1996/97	     1995/96</p>
<p>					 01/10    16/09     01/10    16/09</p>
<p>SUGAR CANE(million tonnes)     176.45   158.16    154.69   138.93</p>
<p>SUGAR(million tonnes)	    8.01     7.12	6.96     6.13</p>
<p>ALCOHOL(million cubic meters)  9.29     8.34	8.21     7.33</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
